# Vendored ffmpeg binaries -- see animkit/vendor/ffmpeg/README.md.
# The Windows build is a ~217 MB static binary, well past GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit, and nothing here is required: animkit falls back to the
# `reference.ffmpeg` setting, then to whatever ffmpeg is on PATH.
animkit/vendor/ffmpeg/win64/ffmpeg.exe
animkit/vendor/ffmpeg/macos/ffmpeg
animkit/vendor/ffmpeg/linux/ffmpeg

